  The reel_script says the 10 vehicles 'did not function for many months' and then 'stand at a stage ready for garbage' — the article says they are stopped awaiting repair, roughly consistent, but the reel_script/slides say 'பல மாதங்களாக' for the vehicles while the 10-month repair delay is attributed to the battery repair; minor, but the 'பல மாதங்களாக' and '10 மாதம்' are mixed without clear distinction.
