factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 7 problems
  reel_script says the 6th to 10th period dates are 'அக்டோபர் 6ஆம் தேதி' (October 6), but the article only says 'கடந்த 6ம் தேதி' with no month stated; the month is an invented detail.
  reel_script says the 94 pregnant women were 'பிரசவத்துக்காக மருத்துவமனைகளில் சேர்க்கப்பட்டனர்' and the listed places (Coimbatore govt hospital, Aranthangi, etc.) are presented as where they went; the article says they went to these areas and were admitted to deliver, which is loosely matched, but the sentence 'இந்த காலகட்டத்தில்... சேர்க்கப்பட்டனர்' merges the admission with the call campaign into one unclear statement.
  reel_script says the place list 'இது பொருந்தும்' applies to 'கர்ப்பிணிகளுக்கு' who went to those places, mixing the list of destinations with the 94 admitted women and the 399/58 groups into one sentence, making the facts unclear.
  reel_script says 58 pregnant women went to 'வெளிமாநிலங்களுக்கும்' but omits that they went to specific states (Kerala, Karnataka, West Bengal, Uttar Pradesh, Bihar, Assam, Rajasthan, Odisha); caption lists these but reel_script does not, which is acceptable only as a missing-detail issue, not an error.
  reel_script says 'அனைவருக்கும் மருத்துவ ஆலோசனை வழங்கப்பட்டு' – the article says advice was given to the two who went abroad (Nepal, Cambodia) and they were confirmed well; the claim that all were given advice and confirmed well is an overgeneralization.
  slides_spec slide 'நலம் உறுதி' line 'வெளியூர் செல்லும் கர்ப்பிணிகள் மருத்துவரிடம் தகவல்' states pregnant women informed a doctor, which is not stated in the article (invented detail).
  slides_spec slide 'பிரசவம் & வெளியூர்' line '<b>399</b> பேர் வெளிமாவட்டங்களுக்கும், <b>58</b> பேர்' is truncated and incomplete, and the sentence lacks its clear meaning ('58 பேர்' has no complete predicate).
